   "resumo_en": "Mighty Garvey! is the fifth and final studio album by Manfred Mann, released on 28 June 1968 by Fontana Records. In North America, Mercury Records issued the album under the title The Mighty Quinn with an altered track listing and different cover art. The album included the band's last number one single, a cover of Bob Dylan's \"Mighty Quinn\", as well as Tony Hazzard's song \"Ha! Ha! Said the Clown\", which was a top ten hit in the U.K. Despite the success of these two singles, the album met with limited commercial success upon release.",
